    "title": "What channel is OU basketball vs Arkansas on today? Time, TV schedule for SEC Tournament",
    "text": "Updated March 13, 2026, 6:32 p.m. CTNASHVILLE — Oklahoma basketball is one of the hottest teams in the country.The Sooners, winners of six straight and eight of their last 10, bulldozed their way through Texas A&M 83-63 — setting up a win and in scenario Friday night in the SEC men's basketball tournament quarterfinals.ESPN bracketologist Joe Lunardi called OU-Arkansas the \"most important game of the day.\" The Sooners are currently the first team out of the NCAA Tournament in his latest projections.OU has won four straight redemption games. The Razorbacks defeated the Sooners by four points on Jan. 27.OU-Arkansas tips at 8:30 p.m. on SEC Network.Oklahoma basketball vs Arkansas predictionOklahoma 81, Arkansas 79: No one wants to play the Sooners right now. They're playing collective defense and their top contributors are firing on all cylinders. There's also something to be said about a team that has already played two games and has confidence compared to a team that has been waiting around. The Hogs are safely a tourney team. Darius Acuff is a superstar. But OU finds a way, again, to extend its stay in Nashville.What time is Oklahoma vs Arkansas today? When is OU basketball game today?Date: Friday, March 13Start time: 8:30 p.m. CTWhere: Bridgestone Arena in Nashville, Tenn.What channel is Oklahoma vs Arkansas on today? How to watch, stream OU basketballTV: SEC NetworkHow to watch online: Fubo (free trial)How to listen to Oklahoma vs Arkansas on the radioToby Rowland (play-by-play) and Kevin Henry (analyst) will have the OU radio call on the Sooner Sports Network (KOKC 1520 AM in Oklahoma City; KTBZ 1430 AM in Tulsa and Varsity Radio App).Oklahoma vs Arkansas betting oddsOdds courtesy of BetMGM as of Friday, March 13:Moneyline: ARK -325 | OU +260Spread: ARK (-7.5)Over/under: 168.5Oklahoma men's basketball schedule 2025-26 seasonAll times are Central Time (CT)Monday, Nov. 3: OU 102, Saint Francis 66Saturday, Nov. 8: Gonzaga 83, OU 68Tuesday, Nov. 11: OU 95, Arkansas-Pine Bluff 69Saturday, Nov. 15: Nebraska 105, OU 99Thursday, Nov. 20: OU 95, Oral Roberts 71Sunday, Nov. 23: OU 72, Alcorn State 53Friday, Nov. 28: OU 75, Marquette 74Tuesday, Dec. 2: OU 86, Wake Forest 68Saturday. Dec. 6: Arizona State 86, OU 70Saturday, Dec. 13: OU 85, OSU 76Tuesday. Dec. 16: OU 89, Kansas City 67Monday, Dec. 22: OU 107, Stetson 54Monday, Dec. 29: OU 93, Mississippi Valley State 69Saturday, Jan. 3: OU 86, Ole Miss 70Tuesday, Jan. 6: Mississippi State 72, OU 53Saturday. Jan. 10: Texas A&M 83, OU 76Tuesday, Jan. 13: Florida 96, OU 79Saturday, Jan. 17: Alabama 83, OU 81Tuesday, Jan. 20: South Carolina 85, OU 76Saturday, Jan. 24: Missouri 88, OU 87 (OT)Tuesday, Jan. 27: Arkansas 83, OU 79Saturday, Jan. 31: Texas 79, OU 69Wednesday, Feb. 4: Kentucky 94, OU 78Saturday, Feb. 7: OU 92, Vanderbilt 91Saturday, Feb. 14: OU 94, Georgia 78Wednesday, Feb. 18: Tennessee 89, OU 66Saturday, Feb. 21: Texas A&M 75, OU 71Tuesday, Feb. 24: OU 91, Auburn 79Saturday, Feb. 28: OU 83, LSU 67Tuesday, March 3: OU 80, Missouri 64Saturday, March 7: OU 88, Texas 85Wednesday, March 11: OU 86, South Carolina 74 (SEC Tournament)Thursday, March 12: OU 83, Texas A&M 63 (SEC Network)Friday, March 13: vs. Arkansas, 8:30 p.m. (SEC Network)Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
